drive.google.com/file/d/1dYToj9duAWDzc2rsL_1AOhqM631HCX3U/view\n\nOther details such as pose and background can be all up to you.\nI hope you have fun drawing her.\n\nThank you!\n\nCharacter reference: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1SN-6bv2vt7XirMXYo5J3oLND3UAehMi0\nOutfit reference: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/17kSYbtNyhtlmRdB1BuuxxN97Q6De97rx", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@cypress_sticker/works/61", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/22c03e0d/uploads/origins/760607fa-7bc2-4759-a760-7f45547d53f1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fb8ec43cf8f981744c5ec8eb39e6c7cb", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/22c03e0d/uploads/origins/760607fa-7bc2-4759-a760-7f45547d53f1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fb8ec43cf8f981744c5ec8eb39e6c7cb, https://si.imgix.net/22c03e0d/uploads/origins/760607fa-7bc2-4759-a760-7f45547d53f1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4075b513ca118d7407f5f1c2fe82d1db 2x, https://si.imgix.net/22c03e0d/uploads/origins/760607fa-7bc2-4759-a760-7f45547d53f1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=803c56cc3dd56fb9f5b83df8f3fb5d1e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "アピールありがとうございました！\nせっかくですのでうちの子の水着を描いていただければと思います。\n個人的にパレオ付きの水着が1番好みです。その他お任せします。\nよろしくお願いします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1CWM7-JeSw6ULnJ3r33fi2qqu2BW_Bz_B?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@cypress_sticker/works/60", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/29c152d0/uploads/origins/1a97e24a-eed9-4250-9849-05332968a2aa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b333ae49117d143c93e3e0f6d9de6b30", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/29c152d0/uploads/origins/1a97e24a-eed9-4250-9849-05332968a2aa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b333ae49117d143c93e3e0f6d9de6b30, https://si.